    "cost-rule": {
      "kind": "rule",
      "does": "Mana cost of an ability: max(1, round(mana x the race's spell cost-mod (races.json passive: Elf 0.85) x (1 - wand thrift) x number-scale)). Elf and wand only for spells (not techniques, not invokes).",
